                                "sense_id": "7000382d-1aad-373d-ad15-fdf2b073b27a",
                                "text": "Der Sinn von R21 sei es, „die Diskurshoheit vom linksgrünen Milieu zurückzuerobern“, das allen vorschreiben wolle, was sagbar sei. Das klingt bei der AfD auch nicht viel anders.",
                                "translation": "The purpose of R21 was to “retake the control of the public discourse from the left-green milieu”, which wants to dictate to everyone what can be said. That doesn't sound much different to the AfD.",
